ppomugi3/works/51", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1377731828497321993%2FbwKIAJUz.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=899f0c91679c4dfa5eb9982f440647bc", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1377731828497321993%2FbwKIAJUz.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=899f0c91679c4dfa5eb9982f440647bc, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1377731828497321993%2FbwKIAJUz.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e46fdb3d76d433b55cab13ba7c80107e 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1377731828497321993%2FbwKIAJUz.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=456cf73258b4a882d4deae91457a4b86 3x", "genre": "music", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、しっぽ先生！しばらくの間、あなたの作品のファンでした。以前からループするBGMが欲しかったのですが、しっぽ先生の作曲だったら最高に素晴らしいと感じました。\n\nストリーミングで使いたいと思います。\n\nイラストストリーミングをやっているので、メランコリックでノスタルジックでドリーミーなBGMにしたいです。\n\n見ている人に安らぎや安らぎを感じてもらいたい。\n\nこんな感じ！-> https://youtu.be/Q9enIlbKEWI?si=9t6EUuz4oREOcOAv\n\nhttps://youtu.be/Xr4KXL6NuLo?si=-HRuPrEgBx1AIFOc\n\nhttps://youtu.be/-JVXiigHNC8?si=bAlBOuB__AsfbPYn\n\nピアノとストリングスの組み合わせはとても気に入っていますが、他に何か加えたいのであれば、あなたの感覚も信じています！ご検討いただき、本当にありがとうございました。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sippomugi3/works/50", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1377731828497321993%2FbwKIAJUz.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=899f0c91679c4dfa5eb9982f440647bc", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1377731828497321993%2FbwKIAJUz.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=899f0c91679c4dfa5eb9982f440647bc, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1377731828497321993%2FbwKIAJUz.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e46fdb3d76d433b55cab13ba7c80107e 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1377731828497321993%2FbwKIAJUz.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=456cf73258b4a882d4deae91457a4b86 3x", "genre": "music", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、\n前回作っていただいたbgm、とても楽しかったです：\nhttps://skeb.jp/@sippomugi3/works/30\n\nできれば、アジアの伝統的な楽器を入れたいです。\n\nありがとうございます！結果を楽しみにしています。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1DTNj9DWqAZDBy8QN-ZpOTGbl4DIR8S6n/view?usp=drivesdk", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sippomugi3/works/49", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1377731828497321993%2FbwKIAJUz.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=899f0c91679c4dfa5eb9982f440647bc", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1377731828497321993%2FbwKIAJUz.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=899f0c91679c4dfa5eb9982f440647bc, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1377731828497321993%2FbwKIAJUz.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e46fdb3d76d433b55cab13ba7c80107e 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1377731828497321993%2FbwKIAJUz.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=456cf73258b4a882d4deae91457a4b86 3x", "genre": "music", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello Sippo,\n\nI've listened to many of your songs on skeb and I'm very impressed. I really enjoy all of the songs you have created so far. \n\nI'd like you to create a looping BGM for my Vtuber persona Poneko. Poneko's personality is mischievous and lively and I would like the music to reflect that. Poneko is a radioactive catgirl Vtuber. Please see Poneko's design for inspiration https://imgur.com/a/rX2VDhh. \n\nPlease create an upbeat Bossa Nova style song. It should be playful and inviting and also kind of mischievous. Please imagine or watch funny cat videos when making this song. If possible, I'd like it if you could incorporate some soft cat meows in the song. \n\nI will be using the song on Youtube in the background of some of my streams and will make sure to credit you. I'm very excited to hear your creation! I'm sure it will sound amazing. Thank you for your consideration.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sippomugi3/works/48", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1377731828497321993%2FbwKIAJUz.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=899f0c91679c4dfa5eb9982f440647bc", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1377731828497321993%2FbwKIAJUz.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=899f0c91679c4dfa5eb9982f440647bc, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1377731828497321993%2FbwKIAJUz.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e46fdb3d76d433b55cab13ba7c80107e 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1377731828497321993%2FbwKIAJUz.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=456cf73258b4a882d4deae91457a4b86 3x", "genre": "music", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！私はあなたの音楽がとても好きで、ぜひあなたに曲を依頼したいと思っています！\n\nhttps://skeb.jp/@sippomugi3/works/35 特にこの曲が気に入りました！\n\nTwitch配信やYoutubeの動画でストーリーを読むときのBGMに使おうと思っています。\n\n私の声に合うBGMをぜひ依頼したいです。私の声はとても落ち着いていると言われるのですが、どう表現したらいいのかわからないので、googleドライブに録音したものを残しておきました。他にgoogle driveにあるのは、僕のキャラクターの参考資料と背景画です。私のキャラクターは、気分によってとても落ち着いたり攻撃的になったりする白虎のVtuberです。できれば、とても居心地の良い雰囲気を作りたいと思っていることが多いです。\n\nなるべく多くの情報を入れた方が曲作りの参考になると思いましたが、自由に作ってください。きっと私に合うものを作ってくれると信じています＾＾。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1gctrE1vijU6qleo", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sippomugi3/works/47", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1377731828497321993%2FbwKIAJUz.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=899f0c91679c4dfa5eb9982f440647bc", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1377731828497321993%2FbwKIAJUz.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=899f0c91679c4dfa5eb9982f440647bc, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1377731828497321993%2FbwKIAJUz.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e46fdb3d76d433b55cab13ba7c80107e 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1377731828497321993%2FbwKIAJUz.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=456cf73258b4a882d4deae91457a4b86 3x", "genre": "music", "nsfw": false, "body": "しっぽ様、こんにちは。\nI like your music very much. I'd like to commission you to compose a piece of music for my original character. The ideal atmosphere is the feeling of two people drinking under the moonlight in the bamboo forest, hopefully it can be Chinese style.\n\nThey are both old enemies and friends, occasionally quarreling, but more often they meet and drink tea under the moon.\n\nYou can refer to any image in the link, thank you!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Gsf2F59uKOs5riAtjKBqxujQSRYi11ke", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sippomugi3/works/46", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1377731828497321993%2FbwKIAJUz.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompre